    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f9b7f254-0787-5c14-9a1d-cdac26960519" activityNameId="2205022a-3ccd-5fd5-9e49-5ab16da7ffeb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx N,N-dimethylformamide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx N,N-dimethylformamide, at plant
The process "N,N-dimethylformamide, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of DMF from dimethylamine in Europe.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000068-12-2; 
Formula: C3H7NO; 
Synonyms: DMF; 
UUID: 18ead1e0-e3ea-3ada-9d8a-029a42350e4c
Production of N,N-diemthylformamide including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Synthesis from N,N-Dimethylamine
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production in the world  is around 250.000 tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_18ead1e0-e3ea-3ada-9d8a-029a42350e4c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
